<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Auto set channel to system roblox</Major>
    <Description>automatically set's the channel to system in the roblox chat so you dont have to type it out manually, this only works on some experiences so dont complain if it doesnt work on the experience cause it might not support commands, the macro types /c system which will let you able to type any messages without needing to show it in the chat.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 56 1
Delay 28 ms
KeyUp 56 1
Delay 28 ms
KeyDown 6 1
Delay 28
KeyUp 6 1
Delay 28
KeyDown 44 1
Delay 28
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 28
KeyDown 22 1
Delay 28
KeyUp 22 1
Delay 28
KeyDown 28 1
Delay 28
KeyUp 28 1
Delay 28
KeyDown 22 1
Delay 28
KeyUp 22 1
Delay 28
KeyDown 23 1
Delay 28
KeyUp 23 1
Delay 28
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 28
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 28
KeyDown 16 1
Delay 28
KeyUp 16 1
Delay 28
KeyDown 88 1
Delay 28
KeyUp 88 1
Delay 28</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>